WEBVTT

00:11:31.276 --> 00:11:33.916
So think of someone.

00:11:34.796 --> 00:11:37.316
And make contact right now.

00:11:37.756 --> 00:11:39.996
The point of this simple exercise

00:11:40.036 --> 00:11:43.676
is to remind us that even small actions

00:11:43.676 --> 00:11:48.436
can have ripple effects
that build our well-being.

00:11:48.436 --> 00:11:53.476
And that these are things you can do
every day in the moment.

00:11:54.556 --> 00:11:55.876
Thank you.

00:11:55.916 --> 00:11:59.076
Whitney Pennington Rodgers:
One way I'd love to kick things off,

00:11:59.116 --> 00:12:02.036
Bob, you mentioned,
at the top of your talk,